Depends: aurora-stage2-trial, ${misc:Depends}
Description: U-Boot for Apple Silicon Macs (Aurora)
 Aurora Silicon's common Apple Silicon U-Boot, including the MacBook Neo MTP
 handoff. update-m1n1 combines it with aura and the kernel's device trees into
 Stage 2; a new U-Boot reaches Stage 2 through aura's trial boot.
